-Characterizes `q ∈ N.filtrationPreimageClassInQuotient UG UH targetLevel n` by the equivalent
-condition `∃ x : H, x ∈ N.filtrationPreimageSubgroup UG targetLevel n ∧ QuotientGroup.mk'
